print a shell completion script

Usage:
  berth completion [flags]
  berth completion [command]

Available Commands:
  bash        print the completion script for bash
  zsh         print the completion script for zsh
  fish        print the completion script for fish
  powershell  print the completion script for powershell

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for completion

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to berth.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -V, --version         output the version number

Use "berth completion [command] --help" for more information about a command.
